// spec: STM-023
//
// Two handlers for one type on one 'try'.  This refusal is what makes
// STM-018's "most derived wins" total: there is never a tie to break by
// position.

class Base; begin end

try
    raise Base ();
except
    on e : Base do WriteLn ('first');
    on e : Base do WriteLn ('second');
end
